Package: nabla-edge
Version: 0.9.1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Nabla Team <info@nabla.net>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: whiptail, curl
Suggests: docker.io
Description: Nabla Edge tools for Raspberry Pi
 Interactive configuration tools, network management, and imaging
 utilities for Nabla Edge devices.
 .
 Includes:
  - nabla-config: Interactive whiptail configuration menu
  - nabla-net: Network mode management (cable, ap, cable-ap, off)
  - vpn-mode: Mesh overlay network integration
  - nabla-image: SD/USB imaging tool for new nodes
